: "3.png", "id": "9195068510586629", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75488379_9195068527253294_2668161467724780624_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UKA-xY04-acQ7kNvwHMtwbt&_nc_oc=AdmaZMiELnPevy9cTB4r4rxF_v0D1ykLy1PJ7BVJdn2u0aEIUeveoS8r-OqNdcNa3Dw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afxl_Bu_HcbyTQcL9ttkCQroEh2GLb0xo9teY-i_NMJT8g&oe=69AC3220"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "985683270137264", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035392_985683273470597_5682883843199344465_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hZf37EwyFlQQ7kNvwEvQzIy&_nc_oc=Adlq2zywq8HeytCfSFzl2Ow-WxmCJLDqUI_-Yp037Cma8COEf939-ID9wjtCntDX4Qg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwK542fi6NR-lePnG2lYp4vlzkbMMDKL0C8fWQu8VKwVg&oe=69AC0C99"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1412420799735316", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974471_1412420803068649_7767631581415265926_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=E-CU3MhgJfUQ7kNvwHg_CjM&_nc_oc=AdkWobTAxKdyVefmofd4bo889o97-QQAQX05pQK1Y844d43oQO8NWoiKmwOtnnIBAU0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfydwvlJ1Ebc_3Hvov0lEsXOddxlwF5SOTFu1rY3KYI2sQ&oe=69AC0247"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560.png", "id": "2484960861698447", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974521_2484960865031780_1569075632799989806_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ApjK8oj7NzoQ7kNvwHJpVeL&_nc_oc=AdkVu_E5kAnFoIMhujSVtL7wRzAt7diVvnYpZ3ZF8GRAn8ZwGuqY7LEmqlTcQtfSTPk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwYGVeKbOwV1x9NaWE8Iu26_D72EarL-85jXkrS4uWa0Q&oe=69AC0B76"}, "display_name": "\uc548\uc804\uad50\uc721 : \ubcf4\ud589\uc790 \uc548\uc804", "keywords": ["\uc548\uc804\uad50\uc721", "\ubcf4\ud589\uc790\uc548\uc804", "\uc548\uc804\uccb4\ud5d8"], "long_description": "\u00b7 \uc0ac\uc6a9\uc790\ub294 \ub300\ud55c\ubbfc\uad6d \uc2a4\ucfe8\uc874\uc758 \ud2b9\uc9d5\uc744 \uccb4\ud5d8\ud560 \uc218 \uc788\uc73c\uba70, \uc2e0\ud638\ub4f1 \uac74\ub108\ub294 \ubc29\ubc95, \uc57c\uac04 \ubcf4\ud589\ubc95 \ub4f1\uc744 \ud559\uc2b5\ud560 \uc218 \uc788\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n\n\u00b7 \uad50\ucc28\ub85c\uc5d0\uc11c \uc548\uc804\ud558\uac8c \uae38 \uac74\ub108\uae30\n > \uc2e0\ud638\ub4f1\uacfc \ubcf4\ud589 \uc2e0\ud638\ub97c \ud655\uc778\ud558\uace0, \ucc28\ub7c9\uc774 \uc644\uc804\ud788 \uba48\ucd98 \ud6c4\uc5d0 \uae38\uc744 \uac74\ub108\uc57c \ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n VR\uc5d0\uc11c\ub294 \uc0ac\uc6a9\uc790\uac00 \uc62c\ubc14\ub978 \ubcf4\ud589 \uc2e0\ud638\ub97c \ud655\uc778\ud558\uace0 \ud589\ub3d9\ud558\ub294 \ubc29\ubc95\uc744 \uccb4\ud5d8\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n\n\u00b7 \ud6a1\ub2e8\ubcf4\ub3c4 \uc774\uc6a9 \ubc29\ubc95\n> \uc5b4\ub9b0\uc774 \ubcf4\ud589\uc790\ub294 \ud6a1\ub2e8\ubcf4\ub3c4\ub97c \uc774\uc6a9\ud560 \ub54c \uc190\uc744 \ub4e4\uace0 \ubcf4\ud589\ud574\uc57c \ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4.\nVR\uc5d0\uc11c \uc190\uc744 \ub4e4\uc5b4 \ucc28\uace0\uac00 \ub192\uc740 \ucc28\uc5d0\uc11c\uc758 \ub0b4 \ubaa8\uc2b5\uc744 \ud655\uc778\ud560 \uc218 \uc788\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n\n\u00b7 \ub3c4\ub85c \uc8fc\ubcc0\uc5d0\uc11c\uc758 \uc8fc\uc758\uc0ac\ud56d\n> \ub3c4\ub85c\uc640 \uac00\uae4c\uc6b4 \uacf3\uc5d0\uc11c\uc758 \uc704\ud5d8 \uc694\uc18c(\uace8\ubaa9\uae38 \ucc28\ub7c9, \uc8fc\uc815\ucc28 \ucc28\ub7c9, \uc790\uc804\uac70 \ub4f1)\ub97c \uc778\uc9c0\ud558\uace0 \ub300\ube44\ud558\ub294 \ubc29\ubc95\uc744 \uc81c\uacf5\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4.", "short_description": "\u00b7 \uc774 VR \ucf58\ud150\uce20\ub294 \ubcf4\ud589\uc790\uac00 \uc548\uc804\ud558\uac8c \ub3c4\ub85c\ub97c \uc774\uc6a9\ud560 \uc218 \uc788\ub3c4\ub85d \uae30\ubcf8\uc801\uc778 \ubcf4\ud589 \uc548\uc804 \uc218\uce59\uacfc \uc704\uae30 \uc0c1\ud669 \ub300\ucc98\ubc95\uc744 \uad50\uc721\ud558\ub294 \ub370 \ubaa9\uc801\uc774 \uc788\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n\n\u00b7 \uc774 \ucf58\ud150\uce20\ub294 \ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4 \ub0b4\ub808\uc774\uc158\ub9cc\uc744 \uc9c0\uc6d0\ud558\uba70, \uc2e4\uc81c \uad50\ud1b5 \ud658\uacbd\uc744 \uac00\uc0c1\uc73c\ub85c \uccb4\ud5d8\ud560 \uc218 \uc788\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "\ubbf8\ub2c8.png", "id": "2069319833533263", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/468725195_2069319836866596_8946935124449417766_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dClZG96Y9ScQ7kNvwHtGONh&_nc_oc=AdkQFTcdW84qIu3xTBHFgcdovQnCg5mcB0nu-ivPfMEa_--ne-KEiQ28VNFaFO8mm20&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyOspL6qfd3a4SpNYcuYj2BmzinvUhieJuHGOtJvNeEiw&oe=69AC2CEA"}, {"file_name": "2560.png", "id": "1958144254664663", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75371508_1958144257997996_5402494376169652053_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hnB0xdlMk6sQ7kNvwFbUKV-&_nc_oc=AdnZJdbseb7Sc8BRHY83McXqemifQnIrJjnfPwloTzlc8tbfYPBXCnTnGQhwwhLaBHw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzzYYkfcx9jKJbI2wSKlstzLdYKm14T2QhIAXgqBZvkUg&oe=69AC20F2"}, {"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateHero.png", "id": "1274294210494308", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001696_1274294213827641_4508473815298717681_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MjZLIjmIIHIQ7kNvwFK93p5&_nc_oc=AdnmgeF1nwSnKPqa2e70JDQG28r5oSHfX3lWSv2tmr36AxcF1JOaliqQJ9efrhjWvww&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxET1o6cbXCAI5w8p_VgF2zb68fbIDtqmAnpU1jELJ3EA&oe=69AC033F"}, {"file_name": "[\ubcf4\ud589\uc790\uc548\uc804]\uc571-\uc544\uc774\ucf58.png", "id": "1260787378515383", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974471_1260787381848716_1546754576997205911_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bRkO0GrLN4EQ7kNvwHhqW0F&_nc_oc=Adlz3Gz3Knt3ctbjhx4mjXq4ABbD3oi3xvjZsOurjAJqTnEZ4sSu14fCDaWf